Modifications (the subset)
--------------------------
Selected: Event, EventInit, EventTarget, EventListener,
EventListenerOptions, AddEventListenerOptions, Node, GetRootNodeOptions,
NodeList, Element, Document, XMLDocument, ElementCreationOptions,
CharacterData, Text, DOMTokenList, and the mixins NonElementParentNode,
ParentNode, NonDocumentTypeChildNode and ChildNode with the `includes`
statements that name a selected interface.

Edits, all mechanical (see the commands in the Phase 11 commit message):
  * `&lt;`, `&gt;`, `&amp;` decoded (Bikeshed source escapes them).
  * `(TrustedType or DOMString)` replaced by `DOMString` (Trusted Types is
    outside the subset).
  * Every line naming a type outside the subset was deleted: HTMLCollection,
    NamedNodeMap, Attr, DOMImplementation, DocumentType, DocumentFragment,
    CDATASection, ProcessingInstruction, Comment, Range, NodeIterator,
    TreeWalker, NodeFilter, CustomElementRegistry, HTMLSlotElement,
    AbortSignal, ShadowRoot (and its dictionary/enums), ImportNodeOptions.
    This removes members (for example Document.createRange) and
    `includes` statements; no line was otherwise altered.
  * external.idl adds the one typedef DOMHighResTimeStamp.
  * Blank lines collapsed.
